Type: Package
Title: Sparse Varying Coefficient BART with GL priors
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Uses Bayesian Additive Regression Trees to estimate covariate
    effect functions in the linear varying coefficient model, with
    global–local shrinkage.
